+**Argo CD deploys.** A green build that deploys through Argo CD ends by pushing
+to its deploy repo, and Argo CD rolls that commit afterwards. So once every
+tracked build is green, the script reads the handoff lines their consoles print,
+and waits until every Argo CD Application a handoff touches has rolled the
+handed-off commit. Disable with ``--no-follow-argocd``. The handoff lines:
